#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can install from source if you want to develop in the repository or run "
"the notebooks locally.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "First, clone the `pauli-prop` repository.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Next, install the Rust toolchain, upgrade pip, and enter the repository. "
"Refer to the [Rust documentation](https://www.rust-lang.org/tools/install) "
"for instructions on installing the toolchain.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The next step is to install `pauli-prop` to the virtual environment. Install"
" the notebook dependencies if you want to run all the visualizations in the "
"notebooks. If you plan on developing in the repository, you can install the "
"`dev` dependencies.\n"
msgstr ""

